      },
      "message": "feat(2d): corner arc radius and arc turns for Pocket, 2D Adaptive and 2D Offset\n\nThe arc turns option gets a radius (blend_radius). No radius is the\ntool radius, so the default output and every golden stay the same.\nThe radius is bounded to 0.01 mm .. the tool radius and refused by\nname outside it. 2D Adaptive and 2D Offset get the option; the\nTrochoidal method refuses it by name. MCP edit_operation now keeps a\nblend_turns: false patch. Slot, Face and 2D Contour: follow-up #1759.\n\nFixes #1733\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
